Package: nitrosense
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: NitroSense for Linux <noreply@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, acpi-call-dkms
Recommends: gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-xapp-1.0, smartmontools
Homepage: https://github.com/napejoon/nitrosense-linux
Description: Fan, power and health control center for Acer Nitro laptops
 Dashboard and root service for Acer Nitro notebooks: automatic fan curves,
 power plans, battery limit and calibration, SSD/SATA/HDD health, history,
 throttling detection and desktop alerts. Talks to the Acer firmware through
 acpi_call. Only installs on Acer machines.
 .
 With Secure Boot on, the acpi_call DKMS module must be signed with an
 enrolled MOK key (see the project README).
